# test/spec/fair/lasso_sf.cml: lasso.cml under strong fairness of up and
# flip only.  The cycle between 2 and 3 must take flip, which is
# enabled there, and owes nothing to up, which is enabled nowhere on it;
# stop has no fairness.  So `eventually x == 4` fails on the lasso of
# lasso.cml, and the emit gate checks TLC prints the same one.

module lasso_sf

extends lasso

fair strong up
fair strong flip
fair weak flip
